{"4641280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Automatons", "steam_appid": 4641280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategize</strong>, and <strong>customize</strong> your<i> Automatons</i> in a turn-based battle for mining rights! Defend your base from your fellow employee's attempt to take your claim. Your base will periodically spawn <i>Automatons</i> to destroy the opposing base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong>: Build more factories to spawn more<i> Automatons</i> and connect your buildings using conduits, used to power buildings, and heal your<i> Automatons.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/0b065c884c27520d5b7595c70dae6c15.poster.avif?t=1781357897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/0b065c884c27520d5b7595c70dae6c15.webm?t=1781357897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/0b065c884c27520d5b7595c70dae6c15.mp4?t=1781357897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/1877a981770b0dbb9a4df647bd8fd214.poster.avif?t=1781357897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/1877a981770b0dbb9a4df647bd8fd214.webm?t=1781357897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/1877a981770b0dbb9a4df647bd8fd214.mp4?t=1781357897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong>: Each<i> Automaton</i> can be customized to have different primary, secondary, and backpack weapons, and passive effects from the selected head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/51dff69621332f09a34b930476fe4676.avif?t=1781357897\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras_big/51dff69621332f09a34b930476fe4676.avif?t=1781357897 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategize</strong>: Each<i> Automaton</i> can have their combat logic customized. Actions can be performed on targets based on simple conditional statements. Logic is evaluated from the top to the bottom, and the<i> Automaton</i> will execute the first priority<strong> </strong><i>logic gate</i> that has an action, target in sight range, and conditions that evaluate true.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/346de89becd4d94fd56c0b76ccf11eed.avif?t=1781357897\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras_big/346de89becd4d94fd56c0b76ccf11eed.avif?t=1781357897 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End your turn, and watch and see if your<i> Automatons</i> can outsmart and overwhelm your fellow employee's <i>Automatons</i>! Get off my moon, and go find a different one, this one is ours! We will be the ones to increase shareholder value for<strong> ZOSCORP</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/acdbcf41298dc6cce11d2b3aae5ddbc1.avif?t=1781357897\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras_big/acdbcf41298dc6cce11d2b3aae5ddbc1.avif?t=1781357897 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategize</strong>, and <strong>customize</strong> your<i> Automatons</i> in a turn-based battle for mining rights! Defend your base from your fellow employee's attempt to take your claim. Your base will periodically spawn <i>Automatons</i> to destroy the opposing base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong>: Build more factories to spawn more<i> Automatons</i> and connect your buildings using conduits, used to power buildings, and heal your<i> Automatons.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/0b065c884c27520d5b7595c70dae6c15.poster.avif?t=1781357897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/0b065c884c27520d5b7595c70dae6c15.webm?t=1781357897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/0b065c884c27520d5b7595c70dae6c15.mp4?t=1781357897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/1877a981770b0dbb9a4df647bd8fd214.poster.avif?t=1781357897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/1877a981770b0dbb9a4df647bd8fd214.webm?t=1781357897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/1877a981770b0dbb9a4df647bd8fd214.mp4?t=1781357897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong>: Each<i> Automaton</i> can be customized to have different primary, secondary, and backpack weapons, and passive effects from the selected head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/51dff69621332f09a34b930476fe4676.avif?t=1781357897\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras_big/51dff69621332f09a34b930476fe4676.avif?t=1781357897 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategize</strong>: Each<i> Automaton</i> can have their combat logic customized. Actions can be performed on targets based on simple conditional statements. Logic is evaluated from the top to the bottom, and the<i> Automaton</i> will execute the first priority<strong> </strong><i>logic gate</i> that has an action, target in sight range, and conditions that evaluate true.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/346de89becd4d94fd56c0b76ccf11eed.avif?t=1781357897\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras_big/346de89becd4d94fd56c0b76ccf11eed.avif?t=1781357897 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End your turn, and watch and see if your<i> Automatons</i> can outsmart and overwhelm your fellow employee's <i>Automatons</i>! Get off my moon, and go find a different one, this one is ours! We will be the ones to increase shareholder value for<strong> ZOSCORP</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras/acdbcf41298dc6cce11d2b3aae5ddbc1.avif?t=1781357897\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/extras_big/acdbcf41298dc6cce11d2b3aae5ddbc1.avif?t=1781357897 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Automatons is 1v1 Player vs Player turn-based strategy game. Build the infrastructure to spawn autonomous robots with customizable weapons and logic to fight and defeat your fellow employee and destroy their base. Do you have what it takes to become employee of the month?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/61464bc1e4c6822ca3a646c253fa3baff919e97c/header.jpg?t=1781357897", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/4e1042fc8c967eb5b2dd7ce7f2352c869b2b056f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781357897", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641280/4e1042fc8c967eb5b2dd7ce7f2352c869b2b056f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781357897", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel, AMD 2 cores CPU at 2Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon™ HD 7730, NVIDIA GeForce® GT 640<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-8700 CPU 3.20 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["YEAOK Games"], "publishers": ["YEAOK Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories"